1200 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I can only make something simple with this little time, but don't let\that fool you. This is professional chef-level.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I can't wait. I never smelled something so delicious in my room,\before. I've always either ordered take out or eaten out. That kitchen\never saw much use.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna placed the dishes on the table.":GOSUB 5100
1230 GOSUB 6110:BM$="Susanna: It's ready! Come sit at the table.":GOSUB 5100
1240 BM$="The table was laden with several different dishes. David whistled at the\sight.":GOSUB 5100
1250 BM$="Susanna: As you can see, I'm pretty good at cleaning and cooking. Now eat\up, before it gets cold.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1260 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: ...It's delicious! Forget restaurants, THIS is the good stuff! That's it,\I'm only eating your cooking during our vacation.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1270 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Oh, you're just flattering me. There aren't any restaurants in\the countryside, so you'd be stuck with my cooking anyway.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1280 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: We never set a date for the trip. When do you want to leave?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1290 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Hmm... Two weeks in the countryside would be boring. I say we\spend some time in your apartment, and just leave in your car whenever\we feel like it.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1300 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Yeah, if we're going to Haworth it's more convenient to drive there.\Besides, I like the idea of going on a road trip without a set goal.":GOSUB 5100
1310 BM$="David and Susanna were enjoying themselves, eating and chatting about\their plans for their vacation.":GOSUB 5100
1320 BM$="After drinking a beer, David started feeling tired. He had woken up\earlier than usual that day to meet the reporter, and he was not used to\it.":GOSUB 5100
1330 BM$="David: I think I'm going to lie down for a while... After all this talking, one\beer is enough to knock me out.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1340 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: You don't usually get drunk like this. Well, I'll tidy up here and go\home.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1350 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Huh? You're leaving? Awww, don't do that. I thought we were\spending all of our time together...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1360 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I'd like to stay with you too, but this is your apartment. What if\someone finds out? It'd be all over the media... I don't want to be a bother.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1370 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Eleno Vision will keep going even if we're together. If this is enough\to worry you, how would we ever get married?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1380 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Get... married...?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1390 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Yes. I've been thinking about it for a long time... Susanna, will you\marry me?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1400 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I often dream about becoming your wife... You're so famous, I was\thinking about giving up...":GOSUB 5100
1410 BM$="Susanna: Yes, David! I will! I'll be the wife you want me to be!":GOSUB 5100
1420 GOSUB 6120:COMMON FO:BM$="Susanna jumped in David's arms, and kissed him. They entered the bedroom\together.":GOSUB 5100
