1610 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: Nope, I'm as surprised as you are. You got any pics of our lovebirds\entering the apartment together? Once our contract's over, we could\sell 'em to some gossip magazine. This shit is gold.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1620 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Vince: No way Chief, I'd feel bad about it! Anyway, how about we leave? The\lights are off. I don't think she's coming out.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1630 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: David and Susanna... Apparently Susanna's mother was a dark\sorceress, particularly famous among fortune tellers. It also seems\Susanna herself dabs in fortune telling...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
