1650 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: David has no special interest in fortune-telling, but he does like\that ring. It wouldn't surprise me if our client was connected to that\stuff, considering how concerned they were about it.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1660 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Vince: Maybe you should get one of your colleagues to look into our client.\They probably have some kind of connection to Susanna we don't know\about.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1670 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Clark: We're supposed to keep an eye on our lovebirds during their\vacation. Investigating our client before we're done would be a breach of\contract. With that said, I can make a few calls.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
